{"step_index":333,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T10:07:12Z","thinking":"**Interpreting Network Address Translation**\n\nThe user's statement indicates a network address translation (NAT) rule. Specifically, traffic destined for `109.62.64.18:9443` is being redirected to `172.30.198.50`. This implies a configuration, likely on a firewall or router, that handles this redirection. This needs to be carefully examined as the phrasing implies this is crucial information.\n\n\n**Clarifying Traffic Destination**\n\nThe primary goal is to determine the correct traffic flow from a client to the Centreon Map. The provided information suggests that external connections to `109.62.64.18:9443` should reach the Map server (`172.30.198.50`). The reverse proxy (`172.30.198.33`) acts as an intermediary, receiving the external request and forwarding it to the Map.\n\nTraffic from an internal backend (`172.30.198.49`) destined for `109.62.64.18:9443` also reaches the Map through the reverse proxy. This reverse proxy configuration is the core of the proposed solution. Ensuring that the reverse proxy is properly configured to forward traffic from `109.62.64.18:9443` or `map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr:9443` to the Map server is the key configuration step.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"~/.ansible/kssh -u superuser 172.30.198.33 '\n# 1. Add IP to loopback interface\nsudo ip addr add 109.62.64.18/32 dev lo 2>/dev/null || true\n\n# 2. Update Nginx to listen on 109.62.64.18:9443 and add IP to server_name\nsudo sed -i \"s/server_name         map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr;/server_name         map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr 109.62.64.18;/\" /etc/nginx/sites-available/02-extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf\n\n# Add listen 109.62.64.18:9443 if not present\nif ! grep -q \"109.62.64.18:9443\" /etc/nginx/sites-available/02-extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf; then\n    sudo sed -i \"/listen              172.30.198.33:9443/a \\    listen              109.62.64.18:9443 ssl http2;\" /etc/nginx/sites-available/02-extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf\nfi\n\n# 3. Test syntax and reload\nsudo nginx -t && sudo systemctl reload nginx\n\necho -e \"\\n=== Test curl on 109.62.64.18:9443 locally on reverse proxy ===\"\ncurl -k -i -m 3 https://109.62.64.18:9443/centreon-map/ | head -n 12\n'","Cwd":"/home/koby","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Running command","toolSummary":"Configure 109.62.64.18:9443 on reverse proxy"}}]}
